  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity-building course: Green Reconstruction for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project delivers a capacity-building course aimed at equipping Ukrainian architects, engineers, and developers with the expertise to apply sustainable and circular construction practices in post-war reconstruction. Participants will gain practical knowledge on reducing greenhouse gas emissions, utilizing low-carbon and recycled materials, and adopting circular design principles tailored to Ukraine&#x2019;s unique reconstruction challenges. The initiative supports the country&apos;s Build Back Better and Build Back Greener goals, fostering an environmentally conscious recovery and laying the groundwork for a sustainable future.</narrative>
  </description>
